test "rank296: Cachet searchable scope passes unfiltered request keys to where"
lang php
expect VYQL-INJ-050
expect_review code.UnfilteredSearchWhereColumns
code
```
<?php
trait SearchableTrait
{
    public function scopeSearch(Builder $query, array $search = [])
    {
        if (empty($search)) {
            return $query;
        }

        if (!array_intersect(array_keys($search), $this->searchable)) {
            return $query;
        }

        return $query->where($search);
    }
}
```

test "rank296: Cachet searchable scope filters to allowed search keys"
lang php
reject VYQL-INJ-050
code
```
<?php
trait SearchableTrait
{
    public function scopeSearch(Builder $query, array $search = [])
    {
        if (empty($search)) {
            return $query;
        }

        $allowed_search = array_intersect_key($search, array_flip($this->searchable));
        if (! $allowed_search) {
            return $query;
        }

        return $query->where($allowed_search);
    }
}
```
